# Local artefacts that are gitignored but were NOT ignored here, which is a
# different list and has to be kept as one. Anything in the working tree that
# the CLI does not recognise goes into the archive: a 1.9 MB `print.pdf` and a
# 1.7 MB `views.zip` were both found shipping to households, and `npm run
# render:views` alone drops several megabytes of PNGs into `.views/`. None of it
# is read on a Homey.
# `test/unit/packaging.test.ts` fails if .gitignore grows an entry that is not
# accounted for here.
